      "gate": "A model is said to predict no lesion on an image if the image score does not exceed theta. With theta = 0.5 this is the ordinary prediction. For each seed, theta of the detail-branch model is the smallest value, not below 0.5, at which its specificity on the lesion-free images of the BUSI validation split is at least that of the baseline of the same seed at 0.5. Gated predictions keep the mask at threshold 0.5 or are empty.",
